 *   → This doubles particles = more crowded swarm
 * 
 * To make data changes feel faster:
 *   → Line 32: Change `this.smoothing = 0.08` to `this.smoothing = 0.15`
 *   → Higher smoothing = quicker metric transitions
 * 
