### **1. Audio Reactivity Engine**
- **Why It Works:**
  1. Web Audio API provides real-time frequency analysis (FFT)
  2. Microphone input drives particle acceleration smoothly
  3. Different frequency bands (bass/mid/treble) map to different behaviors

- **How to Tweak:**
  - Line 20 in advanced-features.js: `this.audioSensitivity = 1.0;` (increase to amplify audio effect)
  - Line 77: `this.analyser.fftSize = 512;` (increase to more precise frequency bands)

---

### **2. API Streaming System**
- **Why It Works:**
  1. WebSocket enables bidirectional real-time data flow
  2. Reconnection logic handles network interruptions gracefully
  3. Subscriber pattern decouples data source from visualization

- **How to Integrate Microsoft Fabric:**
  ```javascript
  // In setup():
  apiStreamer = new FabricAPIStreamer(true); // Enable WebSocket
  apiStreamer.connect('wss://your-fabric-api-endpoint/metrics');
  apiStreamer.subscribe((data) => {
      // Update dataGenerator with real Fabric metrics
  });
  ```

