## **Troubleshooting**

| Issue | Symptom | Solution |
|-------|---------|----------|
| **Authentication Fails** | 401 errors in console | Check FABRIC_CLIENT_ID & FABRIC_CLIENT_SECRET in .env |
| **WebSocket Won't Connect** | Console shows "Connection timeout" | Verify firewall allows WSS (WebSocket Secure) traffic |
| **Metrics Not Updating** | Dashboard frozen, particles static | Check Fabric API status; verify workspace ID is correct |
| **High Latency** | Particles lag, poor performance | Reduce updateInterval in streamer; check network connection |
| **Memory Leak** | Browser tab slows down over time | Check particle count; verify subscribers are unsubscribed |
| **CORS Errors** | "No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin'" header | Enable CORS in Azure Static Web Apps config |

