   - `Workspace.Read.All`
   - `Workspace.ReadWrite.All` (if writing data)
   - `Report.Read.All`
   - `Dataset.Read.All`
   - `Dataset.ReadWrite.All`
5. Click **Add permissions** → **Grant admin consent**

### Step 3: Create Client Secret

1. In App registration, go to **Certificates & secrets**
2. Click **New client secret**
3. Description: `Kinetic Symphony Backend`
